'''Attack on Titanium (Insane)''' is the 5th [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. It was added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and appears every Sunday. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoop Cat]].

