==Trivia==
*Attack on Titanium is a pun on the manga and anime [[wikipedia:Attack on Titan|''Attack on Titan'']] and the metallic element [[wikipedia:Titanium|titanium]].
*Sweet Irony's Japanese name, Tetsuko no Heya (鉄子の部屋, "Tetsuko's Room"), is a reference to ''[https://mydramalist.com/38667-tetsuko-s-room Tetsuko's Room]''(徹子の部屋), a long-running talk show hosted by [[wikipedia:Tetsuko Kuroyanagi|Tetsuko Kuroyanagi]]. The joke is that instead of 徹, the event's name spells ''tetsu'' using 鉄, the kanji for iron.
*The title of the chapter "Sweet Irony" is a pun, where Iron-y references the metal enemies present in the stage. It is also a reference to how you receive an anti-metal cat from defeating a stage that requires anti-metal cats, hence the word Irony

